WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:03.701
With parallel lines, one angle gives all the others.

2
00:00:04.228 --> 00:00:07.828
Corresponding angles are equal: both seventy degrees.

3
00:00:12.163 --> 00:00:14.513
Alternate angles are equal too.

4
00:00:18.747 --> 00:00:22.547
Co-interior angles add to one hundred and eighty degrees.
